## How to be Listed

Contributors are automatically added when their pull request is merged.
We recognize all types of contributions:

- 💻 Code (features, bug fixes, refactoring)
- 📖 Documentation (README, guides, comments)
- 🐛 Bug reports (detailed, helpful issues)
- 💡 Ideas (feature suggestions, improvements)
- 🎨 Design (UI, graphics, branding)
- 🧪 Testing (real hardware, edge cases)
- 🌍 Translation (documentation, comments)
- 👥 Community (helping others, discussions)

---

## Recognition Levels

### 🥇 Major Contributors
Contributed significant features or >1000 lines of code

### 🥈 Regular Contributors
Multiple merged PRs or sustained involvement

### 🥉 Contributors
First-time contributors and smaller changes

### ⭐ Special Recognition
Exceptional contributions to the project

---

